# EXPERIMENTAL generic CLI agent (Codex CLI on ai&): deny-all agent egress.
# The agent reaches ai& ONLY through the per-run credential broker (internal network, NO_PROXY), so no host is
# allowlisted here. Codex's own background requests (chatgpt.com, github.com, ...) show up as DENIED in the proxy log;
# they are agent-runtime background traffic, not task actions.
^kw-deny-all\.invalid$
